window.products.push({"id":269071,"name":"Bottomless Portafilter 54mm for Breville Bambino Plus (BES500)/ Infuser (BES840XL), with Double Shot Capacity Cup Filter Basket (Rosewood Handle)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417HKnvX-dL._AC_.jpg","description":"What is a bottomless portafilter and what is it used for?  Bottomless portafilters are used as a training tool. It will provide you with immediate feedback and can see if channeling occurs right away.  Espresso channeling describes the process where pressurized water finds its way through coffee rather than flowing evenly via the whole bed, leading to under extraction, bitter crema, and weak flavorless shots.  With this 54mm naked portafilter, you'll be able to see the extraction in real time to understand if you're grinding and tamping correctly. If you want to improve your barista skills by using a visual aid to identify what you're doing wrong, this is the perfect tool.  Compatible With:  - Breville BES870XL Barista Express Espresso Machine  - Breville BES870BSXL Barista Express Espresso Machine  - Breville BES878BSS Barista Pro Espresso Machine  - Breville BES880BSS Barista Touch Espresso Machine  - Breville BES840XL Infuser Espresso Machine  - Breville BES500BSS Bambino Plus Espresso Machine  - Breville BES810BSS Duo Temp Pro Espresso Machine  Note:  * DOES NOT WORK with 58MM Breville Dual Boiler, Oracle or Oracle Touch.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/417HKnvX-dL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CAPFEI","source_asin":"B0B8YQP6V9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269071","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B8YQP6V9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B8YQP6V9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":269072,"name":"Big Dot of Happiness 2023 Purple Graduation Party Round Candy Sticker Favors - Labels Fit Chocolate Candy (1 Sheet of 108)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MvZoZ-yML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Purple Grad Round Candy Favor Labels INCLUDES 108 candy stickers – perfect for styling adorable Best is Yet to Come graduation party candy favors. Round candy labels will fit a variety of small candies with a flat, round bottom, such as chocolate Chocolate Candy, wrapped peppermints or gold-wrapped caramel candies. Purple Grad small, round candy stickers MEASURE .75 inches diameter and will quickly add a personal touch to all your sweet treats at the party. EASY PARTY DECORATIONS: Purple Grad round candy sticker labels are an easy party decoration to add to your list of party supplies. Scatter decorated candies down your dining tables, package in small gift bags as a party favor or display in a pretty bowl at your candy buffet. Get creative with your purple 2023 DIY graduation party decoration ideas! PREMIUM PARTY SUPPLIES: Purple Grad round candy labels are professionally printed on sticker paper with a photo-like shine. They are individually inspected and carefully packaged by hand. Simply attach each round candy sticker to your chosen candies. MADE IN THE USA: Purple Grad - Best is Yet to Come - Purple 2023 Graduation Party Round Candy Sticker Favors are designed and manufactured at our Wisconsin facility using materials that are Made in the USA. Please Note: Candies are not included but are available at your local grocery store.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MvZoZ-yML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B079ZC6TPP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079ZC6TPP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079ZC6TPP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":269073,"name":"Master Pan Non-Stick Divided Grill/Fry/Oven Meal Skillet, 15\", Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":54.53,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BNapGpLSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Why use 5 pans to make a great meal when you only need one? Cook up to five different foods all at once on one burner with the Master Pan! Prepare a complete breakfast, big burger meal, full fajitas, or a healthy salmon dinner with veggies. The possible food combinations are endless! Plus, when you're finished you'll have just one pan to clean. Cook faster, clean less, and still enjoy great meals! - Multi-sectional design - cook 5 foods at once! - 100% die cast aluminum, energy efficient base - Heavy gauge bottom distributes heat flow evenly - Double layer of Whitford's XYLAN PLUS coating - Easy to clean, stain resistant, dishwasher safe - 15-20% hotter in center section for grilling meats - Safe non-stick, PTFE, No PFOAs or Heavy Metals - Bakelite handle is oven safe to 350 Degree F for 1 hour. From the Manufacturer COOK 5 FOODS ONLY USING 1 PAN on 1 BURNER No more breaking out an entire set of cookware to cook a full meal, you can now use the MasterPan which allows you to cook an entire meal only using 1 pan. Healther Eating with Portion Control Due to the design of the MasterPan, you now have an in place portion control system that helps you to create to perfect portions for your breakfast, lunch or dinner. Proper Portion = Healthier Eating Leading Edge Non-Stick Cooking Pan Enhanced non-stick durability through Whitford’s XYLAN PLUS long lasting double layered coating which is PFOA free Even Heat Distribution Sturdy structure with an energy efficient base that transfers heat evenly throughout the pan and the side walls ensuring optimum heat transfer. Easy to Clean, Dishwasher Safe! Your MasterPan is perfectly safe to put into the dishwasher, but the XYLAN Plus coating is so easy to clean that a quick hand wash does the trick. Why Use 5 pans when you only need 1 100% cast aluminum for sturdy structure with an energy efficient base that transfers heat evenly throughout the pan and the side walls ensuring optimum heat transfer. Ergonomic Bakelite handle – oven safe up to 350F. Durable for everyday use. Stain Resistant. Total cooking space: 15 x 12 x 1.25 inches. About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Innovative Cooking Pan How did you come up with the idea for this product? One Sunday afternoon I was cooking breakfast for the family. One of my kids asked for scrambled eggs, the other wanted over easy, the wife wanted pancakes. What was supposed to be a quick breakfast turned into a chore. I thought to myself there's got to be an easier way. From that thought stemmed the idea of the MasterPan. Of course there was a lot more fine tuning and testing and almost 2 years in development. What makes your product special? The MasterPan is unique because of it is the only pan out there that is compartmentalized into 5 chambers which allows to cook an entire meal on 1 pan. Not only that, due to it's design it also acts as a portion control system to avoid cooking larger portions that you would typically do when using multiple pans. What has been the best part of your startup experience? The best part has been receiving feedback from our customers letting us know that they truly love the pan. There is no better feeling.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81BNapGpLSS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MASTERPAN","source_asin":"B00V3OWP32","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269073","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00V3OWP32","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00V3OWP32","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
