window.products.push({"id":269177,"name":"Tada Cards Wedding Invitations with Envelopes, Personalized wedding invitations with envelopes and rsvp options Available. Pop UP Wedding Invitation (","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Gp6aqk9GS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⭐️ IMPORTANT INFORMATION - PLEASE READ ⭐️ ⭐️ SAMPLE INFORMATION: ★ Please note that $5.99 price is for 1 SAMPLE pop-up card ONLY. ★ SAMPLES will have DEFAULT WORDING. ★ Limit 1 SAMPLE of the same design & color per customer. ⭐️ MAIN ORDER - PERSONALIZED INVITATIONS: ★ To place your MAIN ORDER, please select the needed quantity on the customization section (from $110+). ★ Customized Invitations include Pop-Up cards with envelopes & Customized Invitation cards. ★ Customized invitations come in packs of: 10, 20, 30, 40, 50, 60, 70, 80, 90, and 100. If you need a different quantity, please contact us at: 480-818-4005. ⭐️ MAIN ORDER - POP-UP CARDS ONLY: ★ If you need Pocket-Folds Only (pop-up cards only), please contact us at: 480-818-4005. ★ The actual size of the Pop-Up card is 7\"× 5\". The max size of the insert cards (cardstock) that you can fit into the pockets of the pop-up are 4.2\"×6.8\". ⭐️ PROCESS & TIMEFRAMES ⭐️ ★ 1. Customization: You will receive a text message / email with a link to our Wedding Invitation Customization Form in order to provide us your wedding information and customize your printed inserts. Design, wording, layout, language and fonts of your Insert Cards can be customized to your desire! Also, you will be able to order other insert card options if needed, such us: RSVP card, Additional card (for Reception, Accommodations, Registry, Directions, Menu, ect.), Gift Note card, Wedding Timeline, Thank You card, Save the Date, and Return Address Labels for rsvp & invitation envelopes). ★ 2. Design Approval: You will receive a digital proof of your design within 2 business days after the submission of your wedding information. A rush service upgrade option is available. You will be able to request wording changes and/or other modifications if needed. ★ 3. Printing & Shipping: After your Final Design Approval, your invites will be printed and shipped within 3-5 business days. Your order will be shipped with a FREE 2-3 Day shipping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91Gp6aqk9GS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tada Cards","source_asin":"B0C3WVSRVX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269177","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C3WVSRVX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C3WVSRVX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":269178,"name":"Verolux Whiskey Globe Decanter Set with 2 Etched Glasses in Gift Box - Birthday gifts for men and women - Home Bar Accessories for Bourbon, Scotch, Li","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xkz8njetL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Inspirational Masterpiece】: Embrace your sense of adventure, love of travel, and enjoyment of spirits with this stunning, hand-crafted, lead-free glass decanter. An artistically detailed antique ship is encased in the decanter, with an etched globe map on the glass and tumblers. 【Elegant Design】: The globe Decanter is the elegant touch for the perfect host’s variety of refreshments. It’s a versatile gift for all occasions. Your loved one will be ready to conquer all seven seas with their favorite drink on hand. 【Versatile Gift】: A gift that fits many settings. Groomsmen gift, Best man gift, Wedding gift for the groom, Graduation gift, Father's Day gift, Anniversary gift for him, Gift for whiskey lovers and for all occasions. 【Good for any Spirits】: Whiskey, Brandy, Gin, Rum, Tequila, Vodka, and Brandy. It suits well with wine, and other beverages such as water, juice, Soda, iced tea, too. 【Patented Design】: Decanter and 2 glasses fitted onto mahogany stained stand present an elegant display in your house. Decanter capacity 28oz/850ml; Glass capacity 10oz/300ml.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71xkz8njetL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Verolux","source_asin":"B0BZ13756S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269178","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BZ13756S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BZ13756S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":269179,"name":"THREAD SPREAD 100% Pure Cotton, Luxury King/California King Size White Blanket - Herringbone Pattern, Soft & Cozy Premium Fall Throw Blanket for All S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917p6nATluL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"OUR SOFTEST & SNUGGLIEST GOTS CERTIFIED ORGANIC COTTON HERRINGBONE BLANKET: Crisp geometric herringbone pattern adorns the 100% cotton blanket, featuring a lovely closed-weave that makes our throw blanket perfect for sofa cuddles, Netflix & chill on the couch, snuggles in the bedroom, and even outdoor picnics. Our thread spread herringbone thermal blankets are the perfect weight—neither too heavy nor light, and are generously oversized to wrap you from head to toe. CASHMERE-LIKE SOFTNESS FOR YEAR-ROUND COMFORT: You’ll have a hard time believing our king size blanket isn’t made from natural wool. Instead, it’s made from 100% pure cotton that’s super soft, cooling, and breathable, so the air can pass freely & your skin can breathe. You’d love our lightweight california king blanket that is an ultimate summer blanket, or can be doubled down under a warm quilt in winter while you’re sleeping. Our blankets king size measures 102” x 92”. LASTS A LONG TIME - ANTI-PILLING, FADING, & SHRINKAGE FABRIC: Our luxury oversized king blanket are tightly woven with a closed-cell construction to extend its service life, reducing shrinkage, pilling, and fading on the wash. It’s machine washable, stain and water-resistant, and washes as good as new every single time. Don’t use bleach or fabric softeners. To minimize shrinkage, tumble dry on low heat. CERTIFIED TO BE FREE FROM HARMFUL CHEMICALS & TEXTILE DYES: Fair-trade GOTS and STANDARD 100 by OEKO-TEX certified, these organic king size blankets for bed do not contain harmful dyes, substances, and chemicals that can irritate your skin. It’s perfectly safe to use by kids and adults with sensitive skin. GIFT FROM A SELECTION OF FUN & VIBRANT COLORS: Comes in eight neutral colors, this is the most exciting gift for Mother's Day, Father’s Day, Valentine’s Day, Christmas, Halloween, Autumn Vacation, Weddings, and other festive occasions. Our large king blankets for the bed complements any home decor and comes in a tote bag that’s eco-friendly and plush. Not satisfied with our knitted king weighted blanket? Let us know within 30 days of purchase, and we’ll issue a return/refund via Amazon.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/917p6nATluL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"THREAD SPREAD","source_asin":"B08KQGQFF3","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269179","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KQGQFF3","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KQGQFF3","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
