window.products.push({"id":269311,"name":"NAPEARL Throw Pillow Covers-Set of 2 Cushion Covers with Jacquard Patterns, Grey Decorative Pillowcase for Couch, Sofa, Bed, Attractive Pillow Covers ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8196PuxXnyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Jacquard Fabric】Our throw pillow covers are crafted from jacquard fabric. Jacquard technology makes the patterns vivid and clear, and they are not easy to fade compared with ordinary printing patterns. They are will be as a perfect accessory in your bedroom, living room 【Broad Applications】Throw our cushion cover on your sofa, you can lean against them comfortably while watching TV. You might fall asleep on this pillow. You can also prepare a pillow for a nap in the office 【Decorative Pillowcase】Pillow covers can not only protect your beloved pillow but also match with your furniture to fresh up your home. You can repurpose pillows to work with a new color scheme. Such a quick and easy way to change up your space 【Package Includes】You will find 2 pieces grey couch pillow covers in the package, the inserts are not included. 16 x 16 inch ( 42 x 42 cm ), tailored for 16 x 16 inch insert. Unique pillow covers with jacquard patterns 【Warm Tips】Machine wash cold separately, gently cycle only, no bleach, tumble dry low. If you have any questions, please contact us. We will help you solve the problem within 24 hours","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8196PuxXnyL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NAPEARL","source_asin":"B09QFS33P6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269311","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QFS33P6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QFS33P6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":269312,"name":"The Spice Lab Tequila Shot Glasses - Pink Himalayan Salt Tequila Shot Glasses - 4 Pack - Just Pour, Shoot and Bite a Lime - Natural – Perfect for your","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vDYfpUaXL._AC_SL1455_.jpg","description":"FEATURED: These popular best-sellers considered one of the top party favors for adults as featured in InStyle, The Food Network Magazine and O, The Oprah Magazine. Our new, patent pending INSERTS solves the dilemma of too much salt in your tequila unlike our competitors. FUN WITH FRIENDS: The perfect tequila shot glasses set! Bring these along to your next get together and watch the conversation start and the party begin. These uniquely hand-made shot glasses have the finely veined, translucent appearance of rose quartz, and actually are carved from the finest quality, food grade pink Himalayan salt. No two are the same! NATURAL: Pink Himalayan Salt is a long-lasting and natural so these glasses require just a little care to become your favorite party starter for years to come. USE: these distinctive glasses for Tequila or Bloody Mary shooters or to serve individual sized appetizers such as gazpacho or ceviche without the worry of your drink or food getting too salty. They naturally add the perfect nuanced, salty note to your favorite tequila. No need for messy table salt, just serve with lime wedges for a bite of citrus tartness. For chilled shots, store your Tequila shot glasses in the freezer. DO NOT USE IN THE DISHWASHER: This shot glass has a natural surface that is easy to clean with a damp cloth or a wire brush, allowing 24 hours to completely dry between uses. It will dissolve in the dishwasher.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vDYfpUaXL._AC_SL1455_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Spice Lab","source_asin":"B07SMZRRFN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269312","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07SMZRRFN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07SMZRRFN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":269313,"name":"Comodo Original CMC9000R Body Pillow Cover with Zipper 100% Cotton Dakimakura Pillow Case [Made in Japan] (Ivory, 20 x 63 inch (160cm x 50cm))","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SJwnpaYUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Commitment to texture】 Featuring Oxford cloth, which is a cotton that offers excellent stretch, durability, and texture.  Each item is made carefully by hand using 100% Japanese fabric special-ordered from the manufacturer and treated.  One of the reasons patrons love our products and use them for years is that we select and sew our fabric and treat it using proprietary techniques designed to enhance the quality of your sleep.    【Offering everyday ease of use】 Made from a special-order fabric that is not only of excellent quality, but will withstand everyday wear and tear.  Since the product repels most stains, it can be easily cleaned with lukewarm water to keep it fresh. This product is safe for children to use.    【Compatible with anime-style pillowcases】 Comodo body pillows can be customized with your favorite anime pillowcase.  You can also use our body pillow case as a protective cover for your favorite anime pillowcase.  Our pillowcase slips over your existing anime pillowcase, letting you protect the quality of your investment.  Also ideal for if you want to quickly swap out your anime pillowcase when a guest arrives.  We recommend ordering a dark navy pillowcase for that purpose.  The pillowcase is designed to be thick enough to fully conceal your anime pillowcase.    【Handmade quality】 While many pillowcases are mass-produced by machine, Comodo’s one-of-a-kind pillowcases are all made by hand at plants in Japan. Each pillowcase is carefully made by hand, from the initial cutting of the fabric to its packing and inspection. We invite you to try true handmade items created with passion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SJwnpaYUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Comodo","source_asin":"B07DG1W1HP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269313","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DG1W1HP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DG1W1HP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
