window.products.push({"id":269371,"name":"ITAX-WORLD Automatic Soap Dispenser, Rechargeable Foaming Hand Soap Dispenser (White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fjrRi7bTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Touchless Soap Dispenser】ITAX-WORLD automatic soap dispenser has patented sleek appearance, 9.5OZ / 280ML capacity and Rechargeable design. Equipped with smart IR sensors for quick foaming cleaning experience. Just you put your hand under the sensor port at 0-2.37 inches, it will quickly dispense soap foam within 0.25s, no foam wasted. 【Rechargeable Design】The touchless soap dispenser is rechargeable with built-in 300mAh Battery and equipped with a fast charging cable. Release you from the frequent batteries changing trouble. When fully charged, this foam soap dispenser for bathroom can endure up to 15 days. 【UPGRADED Foaming Pump】Compared to the traditional auto soap dispensers, we upgraded our foaming soap dispenser with 1.9\" long non-drip spout to last longer and give smoother cleaning experience. No leaking or dripping. The pump made By Premium 304 Stainless Steel won't rust easily. 【Large Capacity & Easy Refilling】The dish soap dispenser is of 9.5oz/280ml large capacity and equiped with a bonus Filling Funnel for easy refilling. Once refilled can be used up to 500 times. In order to prevent clogging, it's recommanded to use Foam Soap directly and ordinary liquid soap should be Deluted with 3-4 times water. 【Easy to Clean & Operate】Our automatic soap dispenser is IPX4 waterproof and easy to clean . One-key Simple Operation, press once to start it and press again to shut down. 2 ml quantitive foaming to avoid redundant waste. Please feel free to contact us if any problem arises during the use, we will reply you within 24 hours and solve the problem for you. 【Warm Tips】This is electric product, DO NOT wash the body by water. Please cover the charging port tightly with the silicone plug to prevent water from entering.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51fjrRi7bTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ITAX-WORLD","source_asin":"B0BXL3H7RL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269371","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BXL3H7RL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BXL3H7RL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
