window.products.push({"id":269562,"name":"Shalinindia Handmade Tablecloth Napkin Rings Set of 8 Light Green Glass Beaded Napkin Holders - 1.5 Inch in Size - for Party Décor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411kEgan53L._AC_.jpg","description":"Indian beaded napkin rings set of 8 green decorations for dining table Colorful beaded napkin rings for Indian themed party decor are handmade by artisans of eastern Uttar Pradesh in North India. Looking for that perfect finishing touch to spruce up your dinner table? Feast your eyes on the Shalinindia Handmade Beaded Napkin Rings Set! These beautiful napkin rings add class and sophistication to tablescapes but are still simple enough to use for every day dining. A great addition to your table decor collection, the napkin holders also make a lovely hostess gift, housewarming gift, bridal shower gift and more! The Shalinindia Handmade Beaded Napkin Rings Set includes eight napkin rings of true artisanal quality. Each napkin ring is meticulously made by hand by forming strong metal wire into rings and then threading on petite beads constructed out of Glass. These Light Green beads shine and glisten like glass, but they are much more durable to help ensure the longevity of the napkin rings. Sold in a set of Eight, the napkin holders in the Shalinindia Handmade Beaded Napkin Rings Set will complement the colors of many table linens and are a great match for many of the cloth napkins in the ShalinIndia collection. Each napkin ring measures 1.5 inches in diameter, so it can slip easily over very heavy and thinner cloth napkins whether they are rolled or folded. The Light Green color makes these napkin rings very popular for holiday decorating, but they look stylish throughout the entire year. Set the table in a beautiful way and keep napkins neat until it's time to eat with the best napkin holders on Amazon! Order the Shalinindia Handmade Beaded Napkin Rings Set now. Make this holiday season your Diwali Thanksgiving and Christmas party truly exceptional with vibrant table decorations items of ShalinIndia Make this holiday season your Diwali Thanksgiving and Christmas party truly exceptional with vibrant table decorations items of ShalinIndia","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411kEgan53L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shalinindia","source_asin":"B07CJHC6FV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269562","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CJHC6FV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CJHC6FV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
