window.products.push({"id":269598,"name":"Culina Nylon Mesh Strainer - 4inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ROmEutcUL._AC_.jpg","description":"We could sit here and have our marketing team rattle a list of attributes and reasons why you should own a set of Culina Nylon Mesh Strainers, but instead we're going to let our customers do the talk! Yes, you read right! Real users who reviewed their purchases to help fellow users and potential buyers like you understand the value you are getting. Infinite uses, great results every time Whether it is to strain, sieve, drain or filter ingredients, a Culina Nylon Mesh Strainer can be used in the making of a wide range of recipes: from kefir to cheese making, ginger bug, root beer bug, some of our customers say their daily uses consist of a lot of fermenting and culturing. Nylon mesh is often preferred for some specific recipes like Kombucha where a metal mesh cannot be trusted. Other uses such as filtering lemon seeds, seeping herbal beverages or sifting clumpy ingredients to break them into fluffy, airy powder are favored by reviewers. reliable construction for utilitarian use Professional grade nylon make Culina strainers sturdy, they endure daily, utilitarian use. They are also characterized as firm enough that each size can scoop a nice amount of any ingredient and still hold up beautifully without tears. It was noted by our reviewers that the dense weaving allowed for a hassle-free sifting, draining, or seeping experience. In addition, nylon a is a non-reactive element that does not permeate food, does not create unpleasant after taste or have an adverse chemical reaction. Space-saving storage and excellent gift idea! 4\" to cover all your needs and sit atop a great variety of recipients from a coffee mug to a Salad bowl. When time comes to put the kitchen tool away, they won't take up any space as each nylon strainer nests up nicely within the next. It's also an excellent gift idea, so share the delight!.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31ROmEutcUL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Culina","source_asin":"B07BYWBMBL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269598","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BYWBMBL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BYWBMBL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
