window.products.push({"id":269740,"name":"BURNOUT Temperature Regulating Travel Mug 12 oz Red - Drink NOW & HeatZorb Tech","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MwZHRcWmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing BURNOUT, the temperature-regulating travel mug. BURNOUT brings your coffee to a drinkable temperature within minutes, and then keeps it there for the best taste for hours! MADE IN USA of U.S. & imported parts and uniquely serialized for lifetime warranty, love your coffee - get the BURNOUT! Using the science behind our special synthetic thermal beeswax called Heatzorb, you can customize BURNOUT to the ideal temperature. No more “lip” dancing around hot coffee. Now, you can stay away from any scalding drinks that cause unnecessary health risks. Popular insulated vacuum double-wall mugs keep your coffee hot. Really hot. In fact, they keep your coffee so hot you have to wait for them to cool down. Who wants to wait? BURNOUT was developed by a group of aerospace industry thermal engineers who were tired of waiting. BURNOUT cools your coffee in minutes and helps you enjoy coffee immediately. Based on bioscience research and statistical data, the standard “perfect” temperature provided by the BURNOUT is pleasant for most people. However, if that temperature is a bit low for your liking, then a quick rinse of hot water before you fill your coffee will make the Heatzorb hold a hotter temperature. You can always reach out if you have any questions on how this works! BURNOUT’s Drink Now Technology quickly absorbs and stores the thermal energy from the coffee, allowing you to drink your coffee almost immediately. The stored energy is then used to keep your coffee at that optimal drinking temperature for hours! No reheating is needed. No batteries are needed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71MwZHRcWmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEXO","source_asin":"B07DJNF3H5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269740","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DJNF3H5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DJNF3H5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
