window.products.push({"id":269912,"name":"Howard Miller Paxton Wall Clock 625-693 – Espresso Finished Back Panel, Modern Home Decor, Silver-Finished Sides & Cylindrical Pendulum, Quartz Moveme","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W5r+Z62pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"WALL CLOCK: Featuring a tapered black panel in Espresso Finish and silver-finished side accents, this modern wall clock by Howard Miller will upgrade your home decor. Be it the living room, kitchen, or bedroom, you can hang this clock anywhere. DURABLE: This hanging clock, manufactured from premium materials boasts long-lasting use while offering a contemporary look. For added protection, the dial is surrounded by a silver-satin finished bezel and is covered by a glass crystal to keep the dust away. HIGH QUALITY: This decorative wall clock tells time with a white dial, black Arabic numerals at the 12, 3, 6, and 9 positions, bar-style hour markers, and black hour and minute hands. It also features a stylish silver-finished cylindrical pendulum below the dial. DIMENSIONS: This unique wall clock is designed with a height of 31.5 inches (80 cm), a width of 11.75 inches (30 cm), and a depth of 3 inches (8 cm). Powered and operated by a quartz movement and requires two AA sized batteries (not included). HOWARD MILLER: Founded in 1926 and still family-owned in its third generation, Howard Miller is the world's leading clock company and a respected brand name in fine specialty furnishings such as curio cabinets, wine, and bar furnishings, custom storage cabinets, and SmartMoves adjustable height desks.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61W5r+Z62pL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Howard Miller","source_asin":"B07FRCX5DD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269912","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FRCX5DD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FRCX5DD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
