window.products.push({"id":269966,"name":"LEFV™ 1000pcs Silk Rose Petals Artificial Flower Wedding Party Vase Decor Bridal Shower Favor Centerpieces Confetti Decorations (40 Colors for Choice)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614fJv6WiZL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Material:Silk Fabric.  Each petals measures approx.4.5cm x 5cm/1.8\" x 2\".  Each 100 petals come stuck together in compact packet,you need to pull them apart.  A realistic looking,weight and feel and have veining in them.  Like real rose petals but not scented, could be reusable after your event.  Great for wedding party decoration,table scatters,cofetti sewing craft and more.  40 colors available for you to choose  Package: Pack of 1000 Silk Rose Artificial Flower Petals for Wedding Table Scaters Confetti Birthday Anniversary Bridal Party Home Decor   These silk rose petals are realist looking and life-like,just gerat for wedding party decoration,table scatters,party favors,sewing craft,vase fillers,church aisle decor,flower girl basket etc.   LEFV 1000pcs Silk Rose Petals Artificial Flower Wedding Party Vase Decor Bridal Shower Favor Centerpieces Confetti Decorations (40 Colors for Choice)   Create a gorgeous rose petal look that will never fade. These lush silk rose petals are ideal for sprinkling on banquet, buffet, cake, and/or guest book tables. Decorate frames, invitations, baskets, boxes, bags, and ring pillows. Also these silk rose petals are great for sprinkling in pools, church aisles, and they make a wonderful accent to any romantic setting. Since these silk rose petals can be reused over and over again, be sure to collect them up after your event and use at your next celebration. These silk rose petals are unscented and so won't affect those with allergies and they will never wilt in warm temperatures.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/614fJv6WiZL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LEFV","source_asin":"B0142GKVR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0142GKVR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0142GKVR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":269967,"name":"100% Organic Cotton Moss Knit Throw Blanket | Handwoven | All Season | Decorative Throw for Sofa Bed Chair| Lightweight Farmhouse Throw| Cozy Soft Thr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XNKSKbs7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"LIGHTWEIGHT AND EXTRA SOFT: These knit throws size measures 50\" X60\". We package using recyclable & sustainable poly materials, this knit throw is dryclean only. Made from premium quality cotton, this throw is great for summers also as it gives a cooling effect & works well for all kinds of sleepers. Our throw is a great alternative as a cooling throw & safe for the environment too. Good for babies also, it is a great cable knit throw blanket. COZY AND SNUGGLY: Our throws knit weave from organic cotton, feel amazing & are perfect for snuggling. Our knit weave makes it ideal for all seasons. These knit throws are soft and hypoallergenic which makes them perfect for people with sensitive skin. These throws knits are processed in factories that have the latest machines for high quality and durability. They are colour fast and machine washable. Perfectly finished with neatly done hem makes them a great gifting option. 100% ORGANIC COTTON GOTS CERTIFIED: The organic cotton is grown in rain-fed farms in India, which uses less water & energy. Organic production further reduces carbon emissions, improves soil fertility and increases biodiversity. No Genetically Modified Seeds, harmful chemicals, or toxic dyes go into our products. Only natural fertilizers, pesticides & low impact dyes are used to ensure that no harm is done to our planet, farmers, workers & you. PEOPLE AND PLANET FRIENDLY: These throw blankets are Fairtrade Certified which means that you can sleep well knowing farmers are paid a good price. Fair Trade also ensures a traceable supply chain, better labour practices, respectful relationships, community development & respect for local culture. Terra Thread is also B Corp Certified. A B-Corp certified business balances purpose and profit and is legally accountable for its decisions that impact its customers, suppliers and the environment. CREATING GOODNESS THAT RETURNS GOODNESS: When you put something good out into the world, something good comes back to you. For every product sold we contribute free meals in the U.S. to the ones in need through the Feeding America program. This contribution is matched by the Tony Robbins One Billion Meals Challenge. A product for every occasion - Our Throw Blankets are the best sustainable & ethical gifting choice for birthdays, weddings, anniversaries better than fuzzy throw blankets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61XNKSKbs7L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TERRA THREAD","source_asin":"B09SX5KW46","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-269967","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09SX5KW46","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09SX5KW46","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
